  m_Name: BattleMage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Battle Mage
  role: 3
  description: 'A lone spellcaster of the United States of Liberteria. Firestorm
    engulfs an enemy unit within 10 m: every Biological soldier in it takes 3 damage,
    always hitting and ignoring armor, which can gut a whole squad. Fireball is an
    aimed shot at one soldier within 20 m and in sight: 10 damage that ignores armor,
    enough to kill most soldiers outright. Fast (20 m) but fragile (5 health, no
    armor), and both spells can''t be cast after sprinting. A Specialist, and a Solo
    unit: one per army.'
  leader: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1926b1287b032e54e952656b62a420a6, type: 2}
